*sclose* | V-$CHIPVR ($CHIPCN)

''sclose(handle)''

Closes a socket connection.

*Parameters:*
- ''handle'': Socket handle

*Returns:*
- ''ok'' on success
- ''err'' on failure

*Unix sockets:*
- Closing a filesystem socket created with a listening mode removes the socket file

*Errors:*
- Runtime error if handle is not a number
- Runtime error if handle is invalid socket handle
